  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building capacity for a sustainable fisheries and aquaculture sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This K2K project aims to convince the Myanmar public and private fisheries and aquaculture stakeholders that the Dutch knowledge institutes, NGOs and private sector can support Myanmar to upgrade its infrastructure for training and education.This project is part of a future broader programme on fisheries and aquaculture development in Myanmar.Eventually, this K2K project and the broader program will contribute to a more flourishing aquaculture and fisheries sector and result in an improved business climate for Dutch aquaculture and fisheries businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
